        "## 1. Load all four genomes (once)\n",
        "For each species: find its FASTA + annotation, keep sequences >= `MIN_LEN[sp]`, record N-gaps, build one gene per row (longest CDS), number genes along each sequence (`order`), and write a protein FASTA. `order` (gene rank along the sequence) is the coordinate used for anchoring."
